body:
To the FOIA Officer, ${component_name} (${agency_name}):

Under the Freedom of Information Act, 5 U.S.C. 552, I request records, from the FOIA request log or tracking system that ${component_name} already maintains, covering FOIA requests closed between ${period_start_text} and ${period_end_text}.

Please include only these fields for each request closed in that period: ${field_list}. No other fields are requested.

Requester names, addresses and other contact details are not needed and may be omitted.

This request does not ask the agency to create records, compile statistics or write a report. It asks only for an export of existing log data.

Under 5 U.S.C. 552(a)(3)(B), please provide the records in the form or format requested, a spreadsheet or CSV export, because log data is readily reproducible in that format (${delivery_format}).

Fee category: ${fee_category_text}

Fee waiver: under 5 U.S.C. 552(a)(4)(A)(iii), I request a waiver of all fees. Disclosure of the requested information is in the public interest because it is likely to contribute significantly to public understanding of the operations or activities of the government: these records show how the agency handles FOIA requests and what it has released to the public under the FOIA. Disclosure is not primarily in my commercial interest. I will make the information available to the public as follows: ${dissemination}

${fee_paragraph}

${requester_name}
${requester_block}
